WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.800
Father: Excuse me - Gate 4?

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.000
Majed: Gate 4? That way.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.200
Father: Excuse me - Gate 4?

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:19.200
Noura: Ahlan wa sahlan! Welcome to Riyadh. Gate 4 is just there - let me show you.

5
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.100
Narrator: Same family, same question, two marshals.

6
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.200
Narrator: One gives them a direction. The other gives them a welcome.

7
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:34.200
Narrator: Years from now, when this family talks about their trip to Saudi Arabia, which marshal will they remember?
